// Extra US 1.0 symbols found for the randomizer, merged with spm-headers' lst at build time.
// relF entries are module,section,offset: section 1 = file offset - 0xdc, section 5 = file offset - 0xaf300
// (offsets in the decompressed relF.rel; see DESIGN.md for how each was found)

// main.dol
8011EFD0:guideGetWork
800E0E74:evt_door_select_entry
800E1078:evt_door_select_set
803D8468:door_enter_evt
// In the "can the current character use their ability" check (0x80147A08): the
// bl evtGetValue(GSW(0)) whose result blocks Mario's flip when 0 < value < 16
80147AB4:mario_flip_story_check
// File select (seq_load_sub draw, per save r17, heart index r23): lwz r3, 0x148(r17) (the save's
// GSW 0); lwz r0, 0(r21) (threshold table 0x803E9108: 4, 53, 95, 125, 173, 220, 286, 353);
// cmplw r3, r0; blt (skip drawing heart r23)
8017EF8C:filesel_heart_check
// marioStatusApplyStatuses(status, lv), as marioTakeDamage calls it. spm-headers' us0 lst lists that
// name at 804CEA28 first (the pouch, not code) and only later at the real address, and the first wins
80154448:mario_status_apply
// Key item menu (pluswinKeyItemMain), using the selected key item: cmplwi r0, 0x24 (Floro Sprout);
// bne +0x48 (to the Return Pipe's check at +0x4c). The Floro Sprout's path starts at +8 and runs its
// script with bl evtEntryType at +0x2c (r3 = script, r4-r6 = 0), then stores the entry for the menu
80188374:keyitem_menu_use_check
// Key item menu drawing, per item (r25 = item id): cmpwi r25, 0x32; bne normal; then the Return
// Pipe's enable bytes decide whether its icon / name is drawn greyed out
80188B1C:keyitem_icon_pipe_check
80188C18:keyitem_name_pipe_check
// Called only by Fleep's join scene (sp2_01), right after the join (names are guesses): with 1, the
// first sets MarioWork flag 0x00200000 and gives an object callback 0x8012CA18, mode 6; the second
// changes that object's mode. Tippi's pointer crashes afterwards if Mario has no Fleep
// Not in spm-headers' lst; called by evt_pouch_set_pixl_selected
8014E914:pouchSetPixlSelected
800F2838:evt_fleep_mode_on
800F2878:evt_fleep_mode_set

// relF: Flipside Tower dimension doors
1,1,cb4:evt_mac_set_door_dest
1,1,d4c:evt_mac_door_section_dest
1,1,1074:evt_mac_door_info
1,1,1174:evt_mac_door_objs
1,1,1384:evt_mac_door_msgs
1,5,9acc:mac_door_select_evt
1,5,9d6c:mac_door_setup_evt
1,5,1ad9c:mac_tower_run_door_setup

// relF: start of section 5 (map scripts and data); patch tables give offsets from here
